---
// Privacy Statement Section
---
<section class="privacy" id="privacy" aria-labelledby="privacy-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2 id="privacy-heading">Privacy statement: What we collect, and why</h2>
    </div>
    <p>
      When you use the register your interest form we collect the details you provide, which are your name and email address, and your phone number and message if you choose to add them. We use them for one purpose only: to contact you about Renova TMS as the clinic takes shape.
    </p>
    <p>
      Your details are sent directly to our clinic inbox and are not shared with any third party, and are not added to any marketing list without your separate agreement. Please do not include any personal health information in the form, as it is not the right place for it. If you would like us to remove your details, email us at <a href="mailto:admin@renovatms.com" style="color: var(--teal); text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 500;">admin@renovatms.com</a> and we will delete them promptly.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
